DESCRIPTION:The Buncombe County Board of Commissioners appointed 13 members
  and 2 alternates to serve on the Swannanoa Plan Steering Committee. This 
 Committee is crucial to the success of the planning process for the Swanna
 noa Small Area Plan\, bringing their knowledge of the community\, expertis
 e in a focus area\, interest in the future of Swannanoa\, and willingness 
